      "writtenOn": "2026-09-26T19:52:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch. I think I noticed that RendezvousElection is checking for lock validity in is_still_valid but EventReceiverElection is based on a kazoo election which does not. I\u0027ve posted some inline comments around the updates I made to hopefully address this problem sufficiently. And if not we can continue the discussion there (as gerrit has decoupled this comment from the code in question).",
      "parentUuid": "b3edd65a_90169ccf",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 116,
        "startChar": 0,
